  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Traits",
      "rulesText": "Amorphous. The shadow can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.\n\nSunlight Weakness. While in sunlight, the shadow has Disadvantage on D20 Tests.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.211",
        "heading": "Traits",
        "lineStart": 24521,
        "lineEnd": 24525
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Draining Swipe. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Necrotic damage, and the target's Strength score decreases by 1d4. The target dies if this reduces that score to 0. If a Humanoid is slain by this attack, a Shadow rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.211",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 24527,
        "lineEnd": 24529
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Shadow Stealth. While in Dim Light or Darkness, the shadow takes the Hide action.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.211",
        "heading": "Bonus Actions",
        "lineStart": 24531,
        "lineEnd": 24533
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Medium Undead, Chaotic Evil\n\nAC 12\nInitiative +2 (12)\nHP 27 (5d8 + 5)\nSpeed 40 ft.\n\nSkills Stealth +6\nVulnerabilities Radiant\nResistances Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Thunder\nImmunities Necrotic, Poison; Exhaustion, Frightened, Grappled, Paralyzed, Petrified, Poisoned, Prone, Restrained, Unconscious\nSenses Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 10\nLanguages None\nCR 1/2 (XP 100; PB +2)\n\nTraits\n\nAmorphous. The shadow can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.\n\nSunlight Weakness. While in sunlight, the shadow has Disadvantage on D20 Tests.\n\nActions\n\nDraining Swipe. Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Necrotic damage, and the target's Strength score decreases by 1d4. The target dies if this reduces that score to 0. If a Humanoid is slain by this attack, a Shadow rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later.\n\nBonus Actions\n\nShadow Stealth. While in Dim Light or Darkness, the shadow takes the Hide action.",
